# A font that may not be redistributed. The ITF Free Font License permits
# self-hosting Zodiak on our own site and forbids passing it on through a
# repository, so the file is served from web/public/fonts/ and never committed.
# web/public/fonts/NOTICE.txt carries the clauses; web/scripts/launch-check.mjs
# fails the deploy if the file is missing locally or ever appears in the index.
#
# THE RULE IS THE FONT, NOT THE PATH. It used to name exactly one file, and a
# second copy of the same face sat one directory up in the sketch's own fonts/
# folder together with two further weights, none of them covered. That folder is
# archived now, but the near miss is the reason this is a glob: the licence
# attaches to the font, so a rule that attaches to a path is one `cp` away from
# being wrong, and this repository is public.
zodiak*.woff2
zodiak*.woff
zodiak*.ttf
zodiak*.otf

# Local state of the impeccable design tooling. Per-run caches and exploration
# renders, none of it a project artefact.
.impeccable/
